WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.220 --> 00:00:04.860
- [Reporter] This is the
2019 World Scout Jamboree.

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:07.100
The event hosted thousands of young people

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:10.350
from around the world at a
scout camp in West Virginia

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:13.033
and was sponsored by the
Boy Scouts of America.

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:16.350
But Scouts were meeting
during a time of crisis

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:17.900
for the organization.

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:20.840
Total membership for the
century-old Boy Scouts of America

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:24.270
was on the decline and one
of its largest sponsors

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:27.140
the Mormon Church had
announced it would cut ties

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:28.333
with the organization.

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:33.160
Now a slew of lawsuits
alleging child sexual abuse

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:35.560
from decades ago, has
forced the Boy Scouts

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:37.193
to file for bankruptcy.

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:41.680
Here's how the largest youth
organization in the country

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:43.970
filed for bankruptcy.

00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:46.300
- So the Scouts were founded in 1910

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:49.260
and they were based on scouting programs

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:51.700
that were already underway in the UK.

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:54.670
They really focused on civic engagement.

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:56.530
They did this through a
lot of outdoor programs

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.970
and educational programs,
really focused on raising

00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:02.970
young men to be upright citizens.

00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:04.830
- [Reporter] As the organization grew,

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:06.980
so did the programs and opportunities

00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:08.400
the Boy Scouts offered.

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:13.400
In 1967, about six million boys
were enrolled in Boy Scouts.

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:15.570
- The Boy Scouts essentially
became this pillar

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:19.330
of American society and they
formed a lot of relationships

00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:21.860
with business groups, with civic groups.

00:01:21.860 --> 00:01:25.210
A number of well known
American citizens joined

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:28.480
including Neil Armstrong,
business men like Sam Walton,

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:31.550
founder of Walmart, Bill
Gates, founder of Microsoft.

00:01:31.550 --> 00:01:35.120
They really became this
group that drew a lot of men

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:36.890
that would go on to do big things

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:39.400
in the world of politics and business.

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:40.900
- [Reporter] While girls had been accepted

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:44.860
into some scouting
programs as early as 1969,

00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:47.930
the Boy Scouts prohibited
girls and openly gay boys

00:01:47.930 --> 00:01:50.400
from joining the main scouting program.

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:53.350
- So when we get to the
start of the 21st century,

00:01:53.350 --> 00:01:56.570
we started to have a lot of
these membership controversies

00:01:56.570 --> 00:01:57.520
with the Scouts.

00:01:57.520 --> 00:01:59.360
They wanted to be able to dictate

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:01.020
who would be able to come to the Scouts

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:03.910
and who would be able to
call themselves a Scout.

00:02:03.910 --> 00:02:05.650
- [Reporter] The group
successfully defended

00:02:05.650 --> 00:02:07.500
its prohibition on gay members

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:10.600
before the US Supreme Court in 2000.

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:12.540
But membership started to decline,

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:14.270
as boys began to look elsewhere

00:02:14.270 --> 00:02:16.550
for extra-curricular activities.

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:19.300
- You had more sporting activities.

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:21.280
You also had parents that were more busy.

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:24.260
There was really much more
competition for the Boy Scouts

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:27.030
trying to get folks to get involved.

00:02:27.030 --> 00:02:28.410
- [Reporter] The Boy Scouts leadership

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:31.100
voted to allow gay youth to become Scouts

00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:34.190
in 2013 and to allow gay adults

00:02:34.190 --> 00:02:37.380
to serve as volunteers in 2015.

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:40.070
The group voted to allow transgender boys,

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:43.640
then to allow girls in 2017.

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:46.470
Despite opening its
membership to more kids,

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:50.290
the Boy Scouts took a major
hit at the end of 2019,

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:53.370
when the Mormon Church cut
ties with the organization,

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:57.484
effectively withdrawing
400,000 boys from Scouting.

00:02:57.484 --> 00:02:58.830
- When the LDS church announced

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:00.740
that they were gonna be
ending their partnership

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:03.640
with the Boy Scouts, they
didn't explicitly say

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:07.470
that the changes the Scouts
were making was the reason why,

00:03:07.470 --> 00:03:09.080
but there was some tension there.

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:10.760
There has been a bit of a backlash

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:12.220
from some conservative groups

00:03:12.220 --> 00:03:14.448
and there's been some
new Scouting programs

00:03:14.448 --> 00:03:18.090
that have been started up
since that has happened.

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:19.130
- [Reporter] But for the Boy Scouts

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:23.510
a disastrous problem was beginning
to bubble to the surface.

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:26.730
Beginning in 2019, more
than a dozen states

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:30.100
passed legislation that extended
the statute of limitations

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:32.530
for child sexual abuse.

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:36.010
As a result, multiple claims
were filed across the country

00:03:36.010 --> 00:03:38.410
alleging former Scouts
were sexually assaulted

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:41.040
by Scout masters and other volunteers,

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:44.380
mostly in the 1960s and '70s.

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:48.490
Between 2017 and 2019,
the Boy Scouts of America

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:51.710
spent more than $150
million on settlements

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:54.150
related to child sexual abuse.

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:56.680
The potential liability
from other lawsuits

00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:59.530
forced the organization
to declare bankruptcy

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:02.020
in February 2020.

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:04.600
- The sex abuse claims,
a vast majority of them,

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:07.300
occurred more than 30 years ago.

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:09.810
And the Boy Scouts have
said that they've put new

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:13.120
child safety programs in
place, make sure kids are safe,

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:15.240
but still it's gonna be
tough for them to recruit

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:17.720
at a time when their membership
numbers are going down.

00:04:17.720 --> 00:04:19.110
So there's still a lot of uncertainty

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:20.590
for the Boy Scouts on the horizon,

00:04:20.590 --> 00:04:23.040
you have these declining
membership numbers,

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:25.390
you have this bankruptcy
that's been looming

00:04:25.390 --> 00:04:28.330
and you've had this recent
split with the LDS Church.

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:30.010
So it's really unclear

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:32.835
what the future of the Boy Scouts holds.

00:04:32.835 --> 00:04:35.668
(relaxing music)

